s=\"col-span-1 p-2.5 sm:p-4 lg:p-5 flex items-center gap-3 border-r border-white/5\"><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-base font-semibold text-zinc-300 leading-tight\">Fast Delivery</span></div><div class=\"col-span-1 p-2.5 sm:p-4 lg:p-5 bg-white/5 border-r border-white/5 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6 text-[#73A924]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"col-span-1 p-2.5 sm:p-4 lg:p-5 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-minus w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6 text-[#EBA900]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12h8\"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 p-3 flex justify-center gap-6 border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-3 h-3 text-[#73A924]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Yes</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-minus w-3 h-3 text-[#EBA900]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12h8\"></path></svg> Varies</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-3 h-3 text-[#D02C26]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg> No</div></div></div></div></div></section><div id=\"vision\"><section class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 py-24 text-zinc-100\"><div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto text-center mb-14\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-primary uppercase mb-3 drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,90,31,0.5)]\">Why 2QT Will Be Different</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight drop-shadow-md\">Good Food. Honest Prices. Happy You.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-zinc-400 font-medium text-lg\">We control the kitchen. We control the quality. You get the best food in Lalpur.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 lg:row-span-2 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-primary/40 duration-500\"><div class=\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-52 h-52 bg-brand-primary/20 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:bg-brand-primary/30 transition-colors duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-inner\">💸</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-bold mb-3 drop-shadow-sm\">No platform charge. Ever.</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-medium\">No hidden fees. No commissions. You pay only for delivery &amp; GST. Honest pricing for students.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"line-through text-zinc-600\">₹49 fees</span><span class=\"font-display font-bold text-brand-primary text-lg drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,90,31,0.5)]\">₹0</span><span class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/20 text-brand-primary font-semibold border border-brand-primary/30\">Always</span></div></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-primary/40 duration-500\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 shadow-inner\">🍳</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Our Own Kitchen</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium\">Better control, better quality. Lightning-fast delivery strictly within a 4km radius of Lalpur.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 lg:col-span-1 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-primary/40 duration-500\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 shadow-inner\">✨</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Quality</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium\">Uncompromising standards on every single order.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 lg:col-span-1 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-primary/40 duration-500\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 shadow-inner\">🌟</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Taste</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium\">Incredible flavor crafted by our culinary experts.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-primary/40 duration-500\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5 shadow-inner\">👨‍🍳</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Experienced Chefs</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium\">Great taste. Every time. Crafted with passion and served with pride.</p></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-4 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(239,68,68,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-red-500/40 duration-500\"><div class=\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-64 h-64 bg-red-500/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] group-hover:bg-red-500/20 transition-colors duration-500\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-500/20 border border-red-500/30 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-inner\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#ef4444\"><path d=\"M17.66 11.2C17.43 10.9 17.15 10.64 16.89 10.38C16.22 9.78 15.46 9.35 14.82 8.72C13.33 7.26 13 4.85 13.95 3C13 3.23 12.17 3.75 11.46 4.32C8.87 6.4 7.85 10.07 9.07 13.22C9.11 13.32 9.15 13.42 9.15 13.55C9.15 13.77 9 13.97 8.8 14.05C8.57 14.15 8.33 14.09 8.14 13.93C8.08 13.88 8.04 13.83 8 13.76C6.87 12.33 6.69 10.28 7.45 8.64C5.78 10 4.87 12.3 5 14.47C5.06 14.97 5.12 15.47 5.29 15.97C5.43 16.57 5.7 17.17 6 17.7C7.08 19.43 8.95 20.67 10.96 20.92C13.1 21.19 15.39 20.8 17.03 19.32C18.86 17.66 19.5 15 18.56 12.72L18.43 12.46C18.22 12 17.66 11.2 17.66 11.2Z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Guaranteed Hot &amp; Fresh Food</h3><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium max-w-2xl\">Here, we assure you hot food. Every order leaves our kitchen piping hot. We deliver within our own 4km radius so your food arrives the way it was cooked — not lukewarm. If it&#x27;s not hot, we make it right. No questions asked.</p></div></div><div class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 text-red-400 font-bold text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M17.66 11.2C17.43 10.9 17.15 10.64 16.89 10.38C16.22 9.78 15.46 9.35 14.82 8.72C13.33 7.26 13 4.85 13.95 3C13 3.23 12.17 3.75 11.46 4.32C8.87 6.4 7.85 10.07 9.07 13.22C9.11 13.32 9.15 13.42 9.15 13.55C9.15 13.77 9 13.97 8.8 14.05C8.57 14.15 8.33 14.09 8.14 13.93C8.08 13.88 8.04 13.83 8 13.76C6.87 12.33 6.69 10.28 7.45 8.64C5.78 10 4.87 12.3 5 14.47C5.06 14.97 5.12 15.47 5.29 15.97C5.43 16.57 5.7 17.17 6 17.7C7.08 19.43 8.95 20.67 10.96 20.92C13.1 21.19 15.39 20.8 17.03 19.32C18.86 17.66 19.5 15 18.56 12.72L18.43 12.46C18.22 12 17.66 11.2 17.66 11.2Z\"></path></svg>The 2QT Hot Promise</div></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.15)] transition-all border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-primary/40 duration-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border bo